            "html": "<div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-weight: 600 !important;\">DIETARY REQUIREMENTS:</span></div></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; background-color: transparent;\"><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><font color=\"#212121\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">46 x Vegetarian&nbsp;</span></font></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><font color=\"#212121\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">18 x Halal</span></font></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><font color=\"#212121\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">12 x Gluten Free</span></font></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); background-color: transparent;\">11 x Vegan</span></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><font color=\"#212121\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">5 x No Beef or Pork</span></font></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><font color=\"#212121\"><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">3 x No Beef</span></font></div><div style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\">1 x Allergic to cinnamon (Melanie Zammit)<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\">1 x Allergic to soy and cashews (Nikki Outred)<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\">1 x ANAPHYLAXIS to: Kiwi, tree nuts, walnuts, pine nuts, peanuts (Kate Goodwin)<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\">1 x Dairy free (Trudy Price)<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\">1 x Fructose Intolerant- no garlic, onion or any sauces etc (Briony Smith)<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\">1 x Gluten Free and NO nuts (Mal Saker)<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\">1 x No whole eggs. Eggs are acceptable only as an ingredient in baked goods (Annah&nbsp; Chikukwa)<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\">1 x No avocado/banana (Mel Bragg)<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\">1 x No raw onion (Angela Dalziel)<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\">1 x No seafood (Kelly Waye)<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\">1 x No whole nuts and seeds (Jane Coyle)<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\">1 x No Cold/ Raw Meats please – Pregnant (Sandra Tavic)<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\">1 x No Dairy, No Meat (does eat egg and honey) (Jordan Fay)<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\">1 x No Egg (Parul Aggarwal)<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\">1 x Pescatarian (Chandima Bandara)<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\">1 x Vegetarian, no egg (Jaya Chandla)<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\">1 x Vegetarian only on Mondays and Tuesdays (Sanju Ratnam)<o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-size: 13px;\">1 x Vegetarian or just chicken (no other meat) (Abhilasha Mishra)</p></div></span></div>",
